00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.600
and provides a more explicit control

180
00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.920
over which target to reduce to for the fallback mesh.

181
00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.519
So relative error or percentage triangles.

