00:07:45.519 --> 00:07:47.959
This is really used if you're having a little bit

183
00:07:47.959 --> 00:07:49.860
of trouble with your high detailed mesh.

184
00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.040
The auto should work fine by default,

185
00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:55.000
but you have this option to be able to edit this

186
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.610
if you need to.

187
00:07:57.129 --> 00:07:59.410
So let's go and take a look at trying to determine what,

