00:11:19.279 --> 00:11:21.519
Also your light mobility needs to be changed

259
00:11:21.519 --> 00:11:24.879
to a static or stationary, if you were to go that route.

260
00:11:24.879 --> 00:11:28.360
But I highly recommend trying to stay within Lumen

261
00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.759
cause it's really great.

